00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:19.520
Walk of Fame and Bob Vance gets one and they all go to downtown Scranton.

474
00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:20.320
That's right.

475
00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:23.860
And then there has to be a commercial and she has to be in the commercial for Bob Vance.

476
00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.020
Oh, oh, I wish we could film that.

477
00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:27.020
Why did we never shoot that?

478
00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:29.680
Oh, Ken, that is brilliant.

479
00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:31.080
Exactly.

