00:43:46.810 --> 00:43:49.870
So we could hear them cackling and laughing on the outside.

916
00:43:50.270 --> 00:43:51.510
So we had to stop.

917
00:43:51.710 --> 00:43:52.510
They had to move.

918
00:43:52.650 --> 00:43:57.530
They had to go down to the bottom of the stairs and set up down there.

919
00:43:57.630 --> 00:43:58.610
I couldn't breathe.

920
00:43:58.610 --> 00:44:00.010
I was laughing so hard.

921
00:44:00.010 --> 00:44:00.850
I couldn't breathe.

922
00:44:01.290 --> 00:44:03.090
He was laughing so hard.

923
00:44:03.410 --> 00:44:06.850
And we took, I don't know, I don't know how many times we started over,

924
00:44:06.990 --> 00:44:10.230
and it was all because of the word pungent.

925
00:44:10.610 --> 00:44:12.370
It's so pungent.

926
00:44:12.370 --> 00:44:14.530
And it makes me laugh to think of it now.

927
00:44:14.770 --> 00:44:20.510
And the only way I found, because I didn't want to keep ruining the scene from laughing, you know,

