It was, it's a very fond memory and one of the best that I can have in my entire life.

932
00:44:42.210 --> 00:44:44.630
It was a great few moments there.

933
00:44:44.750 --> 00:44:51.150
So when you hear the word pungent, know that all hell broke loose every time we said it.

934
00:44:51.990 --> 00:44:54.690
Oh, man, I love that so much.

935
00:44:54.710 --> 00:44:55.670
I know.

936
00:44:55.670 --> 00:44:56.630
Oh, I know.

937
00:44:56.810 --> 00:45:01.470
This scene made us laugh at the table read, and then it made us fall apart when we watched it.

