00:47:48.690 --> 00:47:49.030
Plague.

1009
00:47:49.210 --> 00:47:50.210
We need a new plague.

1010
00:47:50.490 --> 00:47:51.190
Oh, my God.

1011
00:47:51.630 --> 00:47:52.790
I'm saying plague.

1012
00:47:53.030 --> 00:47:53.590
Plague.

1013
00:47:54.070 --> 00:47:55.270
It's a plague.

1014
00:47:56.630 --> 00:47:57.190
Plague.

1015
00:47:57.610 --> 00:47:58.690
I'm saying plague.

