So he has his best friend and who gives a little bit of a speech later and then his twin sons.

1195
00:56:37.550 --> 00:56:41.530
And then I don't know who the other man is meant to be, but no Gino and Leo.

1196
00:56:42.190 --> 00:56:44.150
So Phyllis is now a stepmom.

1197
00:56:44.670 --> 00:56:45.050
Yeah.

